Release builds
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

macOS app
  Apple system frameworks only; mac/Package.swift has no package
  dependencies. Since 1.42 the app also carries Jongi-nyang for Claude
  (Contents/Resources/mcp/: server/index.js and jongi-nyang.mcpb), the same
  files as the Windows app; see "Jongi-nyang for Claude" below.

Windows installer and ZIP (windows/, electron-builder)
  - Electron 44.10.0 (MIT License) with Chromium and their dependencies; their
    license files are included inside the installed app (LICENSE.electron.txt,
    LICENSES.chromium.html).
  - The app's code (out/), bundled by esbuild, contains these npm packages
    (MIT License, see the MIT text below):
      @codemirror/commands 6.11.1, @codemirror/language 6.13.1,
